abstract: Patent-level predicted probabilities of overall commercialization, in-house
  use, and licensing from CPC-section-specific Random Forest models using PaECTER
  title-and-abstract embeddings. Includes all 8,426,952 scored patents and a flag
  for the 7,980,202 observations with recorded application years 1981 through 2024.
  Predictions accompany the R1 manuscript What Share of Patents Is Commercialized?
